<TITLE>Adjustable Shoulder Belt Anchor</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>To lower the adjustable shoulder belt anchor, pull it down while pressing in the upper part of the button. To raise it, it can be adjusted by pushing up the lower part of the button without pressing the upper part of the button.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The slip joint is built into the center pillar upper garnish, and a shoulder belt cover that slides up and down together with the slip joint is provided.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
